 1.Introduction
 ===============

 MegaStatus - a little Status-Tool for CNet/3.
 Not tested with CNet`s older than V3.05c!! But it should work.
 
 MegaStatus is based on Co-Stat by Cowo/Cheyennes. Many thanx to you!
 Co-Stat is available at: COWO-BBS: 24 hours - +49-(0)-341-4795709

 MegaStat is CallMeWare! If you use it, please give me a call!
 CONFUSION BBS - +49-(0)-341-6896640.

 Sorry for my bad english! But a doc in german is irgendwie bloed! :-))

 2.Contents of this Archive
 ==========================

 You must have:

 ms.rexx              -   main program
 megastat-lastwords   -   part 2 - the lastword-program
 MegaStat.last10words -   a blank file (description in History part!)
 MegaStat.lastHist    -   a blank File (description in History part!)
 MegaStat.dox         -   this document

 3.Installation
 ==============

 Installation of MegaStat is really simple!
 Make a Directory in your Pfiles called KeksDesign 
 Copy the Directory MegaStat and the files in it in this Directory!

 Take your favorite Text-Editor (CED rulez!) and change the following:

 in your bbsmenue change:

 at 2; Available everywhere

 STatus | #0pfiles:KeksDesign/MegaStat/ms.rexx}
          ^--ctrl+q ofcourse!

 in your systext/sys.end add in the first line:

 #0pfiles:KeksDesign/MegaStat/MegaStat-lastwords}
 ^--ctrl+q ofcourse!

 That`s all! You can also add MegaStat in your systext/sys.welcome if you
 want to show the user`s status at logon.

 4.Configuration
 ===============

 Take the text-editor and load ms.rexx. Change the configuration-lines
 like you want. Don`t change anything else!
 MegaStatus' texts are german. If you want an english version of MegaStat,
 please let me know! You can reach me at: CONFUSION BBS: +49-(0)-341-6896640.

