 6.History
 =========

 MS 01B  - 02B unreleased and buggy versions
 MS 03B  - released: 23.08.1994
 MS 04B  - unreleased private version :-)
 MS 05B  - released: 07.09.1994 bug in BBS-display removed.
         - Design changed, 1 Line shorter.
 MS 06B  - released: 10.09.1994 bug in lastwords-display removed.
         - Lastwords-program now loop if the user don`t write a
           last comment! My Users are lazy so i`ve decided to do
           this!
	 - MeGaStAtus now displays Uploaded Bytes and Files and
           Downloaded Bytes and Files.
 MS 07B  - unreleased private and very buggy version for testing
           some new features.
 MS 081B - unreleased test version. new features added in lastwords
           program by Eksec/Infect

 MS 082B - released: 27.09.1994.
         - loop in lastword program removed (suxx! :))
         - better and faster design of MS.rexx
         - lastwords program logs now all last words and MS.rexx shows
           the last 10 words! User can select if the last 10 words will
           be displayed!
         - lastwords program don`t log the words from sysop, but shows
           them in MS.rexx. if you want to log the last words from Sysop,
           load lastwords program and remove the line which is marked
           like this:
           */ ---> delete this line if you want! <--- /*
         - lastwords program logs all last words in another file too!
           this file is named MegaStat.lastHist. This is only for Sysop`s!
           You can read after 1 year, what user XXX wrotes :-) 
         - anything else...?? nope, that`s all! :)
         - thanx for ideas and coding anything to Eksec!

 MS083B  - released: 7.10.1994
         - now better design for displaying the 10 LastWords!
 MS084B  - released: 8.10.1994
         - sorry for the little bug in 10 last words displayer!         
           Now 20 chars for the username are available. 
           I think, that`s enough!


